<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>EpicBook | Discover Great Stories</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f6f3ed;
      color: #172033;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 22px 8%;
      background: #102a43;
      color: white;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #f2b84b;
    }

    nav a {
      margin-left: 28px;
      color: #d9e2ec;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 520px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 50px;
      padding: 70px 8%;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, #d9a44155, transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #102a43, #243b53);
      color: white;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 15px;
      border: 1px solid #f2b84b;
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: #f2b84b;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 22px 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 600px;
      color: #d9e2ec;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #f2b84b;
      color: #102a43;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .book-stack {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 320px;
    }

    .book {
      width: 135px;
      height: 220px;
      margin: 0 -12px;
      padding: 25px 18px;
      border-radius: 5px 14px 14px 5px;
      box-shadow: 0 22px 40px #00000055;
      font-weight: bold;
      transform: rotate(-7deg);
    }

    .book:nth-child(1) {
      background: #d64545;
    }

    .book:nth-child(2) {
      height: 250px;
      background: #287271;
      transform: rotate(3deg);
    }

    .book:nth-child(3) {
      background: #8c5e3c;
      transform: rotate(9deg);
    }

    .featured {
      padding: 65px 8%;
    }

    .featured h2 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #102a43;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #627d98;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px #102a4315;
      border-top: 4px solid #f2b84b;
    }

    .card .icon {
      font-size: 35px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #102a43;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #627d98;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 24px 8%;
      background: #102a43;
      color: #d9e2ec;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer strong {
      color: #f2b84b;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .book-stack {
        display: none;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      footer {
        display: block;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">Epic<span>Book</span></div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#featured">Featured</a>
      <a href="#deployment">Deployment</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div>
        <span class="tag">Stories worth discovering</span>

        <h1>Your next great read starts here.</h1>

        <p>
          Explore memorable stories, discover inspiring authors and enter
          new worlds through the power of books.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="#featured">Explore EpicBook</a>
      </div>

      <div class="book-stack">
        <div class="book">THE<br>LAST<br>CHAPTER</div>
        <div class="book">BEYOND<br>THE<br>HORIZON</div>
        <div class="book">THE<br>QUIET<br>LIBRARY</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="featured" id="featured">
      <h2>Built for readers</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">A reliable home for discovering remarkable books.</p>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">📚</div>
          <h3>Curated Collection</h3>
          <p>Discover carefully selected stories across different genres.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🔖</div>
          <h3>Memorable Reads</h3>
          <p>Find books that stay with you long after the final page.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card" id="deployment">
          <div class="icon">☁️</div>
          <h3>Cloud Deployed</h3>
          <p>Provisioned with Terraform and configured using Ansible roles.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span><strong>EpicBook</strong> production deployment</span>
    <span>Deployed by Michael Okanlawon | DMI Cohort 3</span>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>